  "workflowId": "300000317128022",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_COMPONENT_REPLACEMENT_ASSISTANT",
  "name": "Component Replacement Assistant",
  "description": "This workflow agent automates component replacements in response to PCN/EOL notices. It extracts component details from the PCN notice document, suggests replacements using semantic search, and analyzes supply chain impact.The agent automatically creates change order with the replacement redlines, creates disposition change tasks, adds approvers based on a approval matrix document, and emails a summary to stakeholders automating the entire replacement process.",
